{"status":{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179838864666847","id":"2007179838864666847","text":"3/ I use Opus 4.5 with thinking for everything. It's the best coding model I've ever used, and even though it's bigger & slower than Sonnet, since you have to steer it less and it's better at tool use, it is almost always faster than using a smaller model in the end.","raw_text":{"text":"3/ I use Opus 4.5 with thinking for everything. It's the best coding model I've ever used, and even though it's bigger &amp; slower than Sonnet, since you have to steer it less and it's better at tool use, it is almost always faster than using a smaller model in the end.","display_text_range":[0,271],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"bcherny","url":"https://x.com/bcherny","id":"159337660","followers":635694,"following":135,"likes":4385,"media_count":124,"statuses":2600,"name":"Boris Cherny","description":"Claude @anthropicai","raw_description":{"text":"Claude @anthropicai","facets":[]},"location":"San Francisco","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902044548936953856/J2jeik0t_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Jun 25 03:08:49 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://borischerny.com","display_url":"borischerny.com"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":36,"reposts":52,"likes":2575,"bookmarks":494,"quotes":27,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Fri Jan 02 19:58:59 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1767383939,"views":658793,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":{"screen_name":"bcherny","status":"2007179836704600237","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179836704600237","profile_url":"https://x.com/bcherny"},"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},"thread":[{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179832300581177","id":"2007179832300581177","text":"I'm Boris and I created Claude Code. Lots of people have asked how I use Claude Code, so I wanted to show off my setup a bit.\n\nMy setup might be surprisingly vanilla! Claude Code works great out of the box, so I personally don't customize it much. There is no one correct way to use Claude Code: we intentionally build it in a way that you can use it, customize it, and hack it however you like. Each person on the Claude Code team uses it very differently.\n\nSo, here goes.","raw_text":{"text":"I'm Boris and I created Claude Code. Lots of people have asked how I use Claude Code, so I wanted to show off my setup a bit.\n\nMy setup might be surprisingly vanilla! Claude Code works great out of the box, so I personally don't customize it much. There is no one correct way to use Claude Code: we intentionally build it in a way that you can use it, customize it, and hack it however you like. Each person on the Claude Code team uses it very differently.\n\nSo, here goes.","display_text_range":[0,473],"facets":[{"type":"italic","indices":[440,444]}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bcherny","url":"https://x.com/bcherny","id":"159337660","followers":635694,"following":135,"likes":4385,"media_count":124,"statuses":2600,"name":"Boris Cherny","description":"Claude @anthropicai","raw_description":{"text":"Claude @anthropicai","facets":[]},"location":"San Francisco","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902044548936953856/J2jeik0t_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Jun 25 03:08:49 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://borischerny.com","display_url":"borischerny.com"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":1305,"reposts":6921,"likes":54153,"bookmarks":102734,"quotes":1280,"embed_card":"tweet","created_at":"Fri Jan 02 19:58:58 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1767383938,"views":8242391,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179833990885678","id":"2007179833990885678","text":"1/ I run 5 Claudes in parallel in my terminal. I number my tabs 1-5, and use system notifications to know when a Claude needs input https://code.claude.com/docs/en/terminal-config#iterm-2-system-notifications","raw_text":{"text":"1/ I run 5 Claudes in parallel in my terminal. I number my tabs 1-5, and use system notifications to know when a Claude needs input https://t.co/nmRJ5km3oZ https://t.co/CJaX1rUgiH","display_text_range":[0,155],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[132,155],"original":"https://t.co/nmRJ5km3oZ","replacement":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/terminal-config#iterm-2-system-notifications","display":"code.claude.com/docs/en/termin…"},{"type":"media","indices":[156,179],"id":"2007177664290009089","display":"pic.x.com/CJaX1rUgiH","original":"https://t.co/CJaX1rUgiH","replacement":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179833990885678/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bcherny","url":"https://x.com/bcherny","id":"159337660","followers":635694,"following":135,"likes":4385,"media_count":124,"statuses":2600,"name":"Boris Cherny","description":"Claude @anthropicai","raw_description":{"text":"Claude @anthropicai","facets":[]},"location":"San Francisco","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902044548936953856/J2jeik0t_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Jun 25 03:08:49 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://borischerny.com","display_url":"borischerny.com"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":113,"reposts":169,"likes":3203,"bookmarks":2434,"quotes":60,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Fri Jan 02 19:58:58 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1767383938,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":1200773,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":{"screen_name":"bcherny","status":"2007179832300581177","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179832300581177","profile_url":"https://x.com/bcherny"},"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2007177664290009089","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9rtc4EasAELEzh.jpg?name=orig","width":2494,"height":1634}],"photos":[{"type":"photo","id":"2007177664290009089","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9rtc4EasAELEzh.jpg?name=orig","width":2494,"height":1634}]},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179836704600237","id":"2007179836704600237","text":"2/ I also run 5-10 Claudes on http://claude.ai/code, in parallel with my local Claudes. As I code in my terminal, I will often hand off local sessions to web (using &), or manually kick off sessions in Chrome, and sometimes I will --teleport back and forth. I also start a few sessions from my phone (from the Claude iOS app) every morning and throughout the day, and check in on them later.","raw_text":{"text":"2/ I also run 5-10 Claudes on https://t.co/pEWPQoSq5t, in parallel with my local Claudes. As I code in my terminal, I will often hand off local sessions to web (using &), or manually kick off sessions in Chrome, and sometimes I will --teleport back and forth. I also start a few sessions from my phone (from the Claude iOS app) every morning and throughout the day, and check in on them later.","display_text_range":[0,393],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[30,53],"original":"https://t.co/pEWPQoSq5t","replacement":"http://claude.ai/code","display":"claude.ai/code"},{"type":"media","indices":[283,306],"id":"2007161114598203392","display":"pic.x.com/HHFyconymH","original":"https://t.co/HHFyconymH","replacement":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179836704600237/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bcherny","url":"https://x.com/bcherny","id":"159337660","followers":635694,"following":135,"likes":4385,"media_count":124,"statuses":2600,"name":"Boris Cherny","description":"Claude @anthropicai","raw_description":{"text":"Claude @anthropicai","facets":[]},"location":"San Francisco","banner_url":"","avat