ten tag @.claude on my coworkers' PRs to add something to the http://CLAUDE.md as part of the PR. We use the Claude Code Github action (/install-github-action) for this. It's our version of @danshipper's Compounding Engineering","raw_text":{"text":"5/ During code review, I will often tag @.claude on my coworkers' PRs to add something to the https://t.co/v4FOLUBHz9 as part of the PR. We use the Claude Code Github action (/install-github-action) for this. It's our version of @danshipper's Compounding Engineering https://t.co/VIQYZ2hFq5","display_text_range":[0,266],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[94,117],"original":"https://t.co/v4FOLUBHz9","replacement":"http://CLAUDE.md","display":"CLAUDE.md"},{"type":"mention","indices":[229,240],"original":"danshipper","id":"19829693"},{"type":"media","indices":[267,290],"id":"2007164735637336066","display":"pic.x.com/VIQYZ2hFq5","original":"https://t.co/VIQYZ2hFq5","replacement":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179842928947333/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bcherny","url":"https://x.com/bcherny","id":"159337660","followers":635694,"following":135,"likes":4385,"media_count":124,"statuses":2600,"name":"Boris Cherny","description":"Claude @anthropicai","raw_description":{"text":"Claude @anthropicai","facets":[]},"location":"San Francisco","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902044548936953856/J2jeik0t_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Jun 25 03:08:49 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://borischerny.com","display_url":"borischerny.com"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":23,"reposts":50,"likes":1766,"bookmarks":759,"quotes":16,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Fri Jan 02 19:59:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1767383940,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":653822,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":{"screen_name":"bcherny","status":"2007179840848597422","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179840848597422","profile_url":"https://x.com/bcherny"},"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2007164735637336066","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9rhsVFasAIUCYj.jpg?name=orig","width":1590,"height":1344}],"photos":[{"type":"photo","id":"2007164735637336066","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9rhsVFasAIUCYj.jpg?name=orig","width":1590,"height":1344}]},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179845336527000","id":"2007179845336527000","text":"6/ Most sessions start in Plan mode (shift+tab twice). If my goal is to write a Pull Request, I will use Plan mode, and go back and forth with Claude until I like its plan. From there, I switch into auto-accept edits mode and Claude can usually 1-shot it. A good plan is really important!","raw_text":{"text":"6/ Most sessions start in Plan mode (shift+tab twice). If my goal is to write a Pull Request, I will use Plan mode, and go back and forth with Claude until I like its plan. From there, I switch into auto-accept edits mode and Claude can usually 1-shot it. A good plan is really important!","display_text_range":[0,288],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[278,301],"id":"2007166610302480388","display":"pic.x.com/Rcy7szkLRR","original":"https://t.co/Rcy7szkLRR","replacement":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179845336527000/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bcherny","url":"https://x.com/bcherny","id":"159337660","followers":635694,"following":135,"likes":4385,"media_count":124,"statuses":2600,"name":"Boris Cherny","description":"Claude @anthropicai","raw_description":{"text":"Claude @anthropicai","facets":[]},"location":"San Francisco","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902044548936953856/J2jeik0t_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Jun 25 03:08:49 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://borischerny.com","display_url":"borischerny.com"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":24,"reposts":50,"likes":2100,"bookmarks":628,"quotes":28,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Fri Jan 02 19:59:01 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1767383941,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":546957,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":{"screen_name":"bcherny","status":"2007179842928947333","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179842928947333","profile_url":"https://x.com/bcherny"},"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2007166610302480388","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9rjZcwasAQpPN6.png?name=orig","width":896,"height":274}],"photos":[{"type":"photo","id":"2007166610302480388","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G9rjZcwasAQpPN6.png?name=orig","width":896,"height":274}]},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179847949500714","id":"2007179847949500714","text":"7/ I use slash commands for every \"inner loop\" workflow that I end up doing many times a day. This saves me from repeated prompting, and makes it so Claude can use these workflows, too. Commands are checked into git and live in .claude/commands/.\n\nFor example, Claude and I use a /commit-push-pr slash command dozens of times every day. The command uses inline bash to pre-compute git status and a few other pieces of info to make the command run quickly and avoid back-and-forth with the model (https://code.claude.com/docs/en/slash-commands#bash-command-execution)","raw_text":{"text":"7/ I use slash commands for every \"inner loop\" workflow that I end up doing many times a day. This saves me from repeated prompting, and makes it so Claude can use these workflows, too. Commands are checked into git and live in .claude/commands/.\n\nFor example, Claude and I use a /commit-push-pr slash command dozens of times every day. The command uses inline bash to pre-compute git status and a few other pieces of info to make the command run quickly and avoid back-and-forth with th